ub-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/gzip","state":"uploaded","size":70510131,"digest":"sha256:50a060209703c6ef3539ac9d61a44548ab3a1504451db0dc1e9729cf0a2121d9","download_count":58,"created_at":"2026-11-02T18:51:21Z","updated_at":"2026-11-02T18:51:25Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/releases/download/v3.99.8/trufflehog_3.99.8_windows_arm64.tar.gz"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/tarball/v3.99.8","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/zipball/v3.99.8","body":"## What's Changed\r\n* Skip GitHub comment errors when issues or PRs are off by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5467\r\n* [SCAN-180]: Populate SecretParts for custom detector results by @casey-tran in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5470\r\n* Clean up S3 source logging for per-source debug by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5481\r\n* Clean up GitHub source logging for per-source debug by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5457\r\n* feat(detectors): add Composio API key detector by @groovyBugify in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5322\r\n* Clean up Docker source logging for per-source debug by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5494\r\n* Add source fields to Init logs in single-source CLI commands by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5466\r\n* Close Couchbase clusters after verification and honor the context by @unsmith in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5489\r\n* [SCAN-317] Recover from detector panics in the verification overlap worker by @dipto-truffle in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5495\r\n* Cap 7z LZMA and LZMA2 dictionary sizes and keep scanning past refused entries by @bryanbeverly in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5483\r\n* Update module github.com/go-git/go-git/v5 to v5.19.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5480\r\n* Update module github.com/jlaffaye/ftp to v0.2.4 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5365\r\n* Update module github.com/mattn/go-isatty to v0.0.24 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5366\r\n* Clean up GitLab source logging for per-source debug by @kashifkhan0771 in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5485\r\n* Verify BoxOauth credentials only when Box issues a token for a subject by @unsmith in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5498\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @groovyBugify made their first contribution in https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/pull/5322\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/compare/v3.99.7...v3.99.8","mentions_count":7}